<h1 data-copy-en="Saline" data-copy-zh="Saline">Saline</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Follow Saline’s complete recruitment route, including conversations, dates and the move to the Medical Bay." data-copy-zh="按顺序完成 Saline 的招募路线，核对谈心、约会，以及搬入医疗室后的拜访方式。">Follow Saline’s complete recruitment route, including conversations, dates and the move to the Medical Bay.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Saline’s route and recruitment</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Clinic first, Medical Bay later</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Visit sequence</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Affection, dates and Patient Observation</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">Saline 的路线与招募</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">先去诊所，招募后去医疗室</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">按顺序推进</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">日常好感、约会与患者观察</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">下一步不出现时</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Personal_Content"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Find_Saline"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Saline’s route and recruitment</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Saline — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/saline.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Saline — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/saline.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Saline — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Saline is the nurse at the Bio-Optimization Medical Center. Her route opens after <strong>Build Our Ranks (Story 66)</strong> and combines ten visits, three Heart-to-Hearts, two dates and Patient Observation. Completing it recruits her as an army medic and moves her to the Medical Bay.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Clinic first, Medical Bay later</h2><p>Before recruitment, find her at <strong>Future → Fringe Zone → Bio-Optimization Medical Center,06:00–21:59 daily</strong>. Her personal actions unlock after Build Our Ranks; no affection grind is needed to start the first visit.</p><p>After <strong>The First Open Door</strong>, she moves permanently to the <strong>Medical Bay</strong>, reached from the <strong>Operations Center</strong>. She keeps <strong>06:00–21:59</strong> hours and her regular personal actions.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Visit sequence</h2><p>Enter the listed location <strong>06:00–21:59</strong> to trigger each visit once its requirements are met. Complete the preceding visits in order, and return to Operations for the two entries marked there.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Visit in order</th><th scope="col">Relationship</th><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Additional requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Human Exception</th><td data-label="Relationship">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Location">Bio-Optimization Medical Center</td><td data-label="Additional requirement">Build Our Ranks (Story 66)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Unbillable Act</th><td data-label="Relationship">Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Location">Bio-Optimization Medical Center</td><td data-label="Additional requirement">Previous visit</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The End of Her Shift</th><td data-label="Relationship">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Location">Bio-Optimization Medical Center</td><td data-label="Additional requirement">Previous visit</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">More Than Reassurance</th><td data-label="Relationship">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Location">Bio-Optimization Medical Center</td><td data-label="Additional requirement">Five Minutes Seated</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Safe to Leave</th><td data-label="Relationship">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Location">Bio-Optimization Medical Center</td><td data-label="Additional requirement">Previous visit</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Place for Care</th><td data-label="Relationship">Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Location">Operations Center</td><td data-label="Additional requirement">Previous visit</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Off Duty Means Off Duty</th><td data-label="Relationship">Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Location">Bio-Optimization Medical Center</td><td data-label="Additional requirement">What She Keeps</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">More Than Gratitude</th><td data-label="Relationship">Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Location">Bio-Optimization Medical Center</td><td data-label="Additional requirement">Stay a Little Longer</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Her Own Terms</th><td data-label="Relationship">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Location">Bio-Optimization Medical Center</td><td data-label="Additional requirement">Previous visit</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The First Open Door</th><td data-label="Relationship">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Location">Operations Center</td><td data-label="Additional requirement">All earlier visits, all three H 2 Hs, both dates and Patient Observation</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Heart-to-Heart</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Start</th><th scope="col">Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Five Minutes Seated</th><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)；The End of Her Shift</td><td data-label="Start">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost">60 min; 15 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What She Keeps</th><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200)；A Place for Care + first H 2 H</td><td data-label="Start">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost">60 min; 15 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stay a Little Longer</th><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400)；Off Duty Means Off Duty + previous H 2 H</td><td data-label="Start">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost">60 min; 15 Energy</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The three conversations start from her portrait and complete once each. <strong>More Than Gratitude</strong> establishes dating. Recruitment then requires the full checklist above, not an extra battle victory or an earlier-story deadline.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Suggested_Clinic_Visit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Clinic_Actions_and_Rewards"></span><h2>Affection, dates and Patient Observation</h2><p><strong>Talk:</strong>15 minutes, 1 base affection, five positive talks daily. <strong>Give Chocolate:</strong>10 minutes, one Chocolate, 4 base affection, twice daily; it has no additional relationship-stage requirement once her route is open. Preferred stats are <strong>Intelligence 35, Perception 35 and Communication 35</strong>; learned <strong>Empathy</strong> improves gains.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Required date</th><th scope="col">Relationship / start</th><th scope="col">Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">An Unscripted Afternoon</th><td data-label="Relationship / start">Friend (100)；12:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost">120 min; $80; 25 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nothing on Prescription</th><td data-label="Relationship / start">Crush (400)；18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Cost">120 min; $80; 25 Energy</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Choose the dates from her current portrait. Each completes once; both are needed for recruitment. At <strong>Close Friend (200)</strong>, <strong>Patient Observation</strong> costs <strong>45 minutes and 10 Energy</strong>, awards <strong>+1 Perception</strong> once and 8 direct affection. It is another required recruitment step. A New Game+ revisit does not duplicate an already retained stat reward.</p><p>After recruitment, check the Army guide for her medic role and the Tower Defense guides for deployment. Cid’s services and Nova’s medical activities remain separate contacts.</p><p>Affection figures are base values before favorite-stat and learned-skill bonuses. Ordinary affection sets the relationship stage; each activity still has its own prerequisites. Listed time windows are start times; their ending hour is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_an_Option_Is_Missing"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>No personal menu yet: finish Build Our Ranks (Story 66).</li><li>A Place for Care and The First Open Door occur at Operations, not at the clinic.</li><li>For an evening H 2 H, start between 18:00 and 20:59 and complete the preceding plot and H 2 H.</li><li>A strong relationship does not replace the two dates or Patient Observation. Check all three when recruitment will not start.</li><li>After recruitment, look in the Medical Bay instead of returning to the Fringe clinic.</li><li>Communications identifies her next unfinished recruitment step. There is no need to win another battle merely to unlock this route.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Army — Saline’s medic role</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense — Operations and deployment</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — affection stages</a></li><li><a href="character-cid.html">Cid — technical services</a></li><li><a href="character-nova.html">Nova — separate medical contact</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Personal_Content"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Find_Saline"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>Saline 的路线与招募</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Saline 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/saline.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Saline 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/saline.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Saline 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Saline 是生物优化医疗中心的护士。完成<strong>「壮大我们的队伍」（主线 66）</strong>后，她的路线开放：十次剧情拜访、三次谈心、两场约会，以及「患者观察」。全部完成后，她会作为军队医护加入，并搬到医疗室。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>先去诊所，招募后去医疗室</h2><p>招募前，她每天<strong>06:00–21:59</strong>位于<strong>未来 → 边缘区 → 生物优化医疗中心</strong>。完成「壮大我们的队伍」才会开放个人行动，初次剧情不需要预先刷好感。</p><p>完成<strong>「第一扇敞开的门」</strong>后，她会永久搬到<strong>医疗室</strong>，从<strong>作战中心</strong>进入。时间仍为<strong>06:00–21:59</strong>，日常个人行动也会保留。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>按顺序推进</h2><p>满足条件后，在<strong>06:00–21:59</strong>进入表中地点，每次剧情会自动发生一次。按顺序完成前面的拜访，其中两次要专程回作战中心。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">按顺序拜访</th><th scope="col">关系要求</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">额外条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">人类例外</th><td data-label="关系要求">陌生人（Stranger，0）</td><td data-label="地点">生物优化医疗中心</td><td data-label="额外条件">完成「壮大我们的队伍」（主线 66）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无法计费的善举</th><td data-label="关系要求">已遇见（Acknowledged，10）</td><td data-label="地点">生物优化医疗中心</td><td data-label="额外条件">上一次剧情</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她的下班时间</th><td data-label="关系要求">已知（Known，25）</td><td data-label="地点">生物优化医疗中心</td><td data-label="额外条件">上一次剧情</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不只是安抚</th><td data-label="关系要求">朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="地点">生物优化医疗中心</td><td data-label="额外条件">「坐下五分钟」</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">可以放心离开</th><td data-label="关系要求">朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="地点">生物优化医疗中心</td><td data-label="额外条件">上一次剧情</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">留给照护的地方</th><td data-label="关系要求">亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="地点">作战中心</td><td data-label="额外条件">上一次剧情</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">下班就是下班</th><td data-label="关系要求">迷恋（Crush，400）</td><td data-label="地点">生物优化医疗中心</td><td data-label="额外条件">「只为自己保留的事」</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不只是感谢</th><td data-label="关系要求">迷恋（Crush，400）</td><td data-label="地点">生物优化医疗中心</td><td data-label="额外条件">「再多留一会儿」</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她自己的条件</th><td data-label="关系要求">浪漫感（Romantic，800）</td><td data-label="地点">生物优化医疗中心</td><td data-label="额外条件">上一次剧情</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第一扇敞开的门</th><td data-label="关系要求">浪漫感（Romantic，800）</td><td data-label="地点">作战中心</td><td data-label="额外条件">此前全部拜访、三次谈心、两场约会与「患者观察」</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">坐下五分钟</th><td data-label="条件">相识（Acquaintance，50）；完成「她的下班时间」</td><td data-label="开始时段">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗">60 分钟；15 精力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">只为自己保留的事</th><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）；完成「留给照护的地方」与上一次谈心</td><td data-label="开始时段">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗">60 分钟；15 精力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">再多留一会儿</th><td data-label="条件">迷恋（Crush，400）；完成「下班就是下班」与上一次谈心</td><td data-label="开始时段">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗">60 分钟；15 精力</td></tr></tbody></table><p>三次谈心从她的头像发起，各完成一次。<strong>「不只是感谢」</strong>会确立交往关系。招募看的是上面的完整清单，不要求额外打赢一场战斗，也没有较早主线的截止期限。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Suggested_Clinic_Visit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Clinic_Actions_and_Rewards"></span><h2>日常好感、约会与患者观察</h2><p><strong>交谈：</strong>15 分钟、1 点基础好感，每天五次正向收益。<strong>赠送巧克力：</strong>10 分钟、1 份巧克力、4 点基础好感，每天两次；路线开放后没有额外关系阶段要求。她偏好的属性是<strong>智力 35、感知 35、沟通 35</strong>，学会<strong>共情</strong>也能提高收益。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">必需约会</th><th scope="col">关系／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">没有指令的午后</th><td data-label="关系／开始时段">朋友（Friend，100）；12:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗">120 分钟；80 财富；25 精力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不在处方上的快乐</th><td data-label="关系／开始时段">迷恋（Crush，400）；18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="消耗">120 分钟；80 财富；25 精力</td></tr></tbody></table><p>从她当前所在地的头像发起约会，每场只完成一次，两场都是招募条件。达到<strong>亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</strong>后可进行<strong>「患者观察」</strong>：<strong>45 分钟、10 精力</strong>，一次性获得<strong>感知 +1</strong>及 8 点直接好感；这也是招募必做的一步。新游戏＋不会再次发放已经保留的属性奖励。</p><p>招募后的医护作用见军队指南，部署方法见塔防指南。Cid 的服务与 Nova 的医疗活动仍是各自独立的内容。</p><p>表中的好感是基础值，会受到偏好属性、已学技能等加成影响。关系阶段取决于普通好感，其他活动的前置条件仍需分别满足。时间范围表示开始行动的时段，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_an_Option_Is_Missing"></span><h2>下一步不出现时</h2><ul><li>没有个人菜单：先完成「壮大我们的队伍」（主线 66）。</li><li>「留给照护的地方」与「第一扇敞开的门」在作战中心发生，不在诊所。</li><li>晚间谈心要在 18:00–20:59 开始，并完成对应剧情与上一次谈心。</li><li>高好感不能代替两场约会和「患者观察」；招募卡住时逐项核对。</li><li>招募后到医疗室找她，不必继续去边缘区诊所等。</li><li>通讯会指出她尚未完成的下一项招募步骤；单纯解锁这条路线不需要再打一场胜仗。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">军队：Saline 的医护定位</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">塔防：作战中心与部署</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系：好感阶段</a></li><li><a href="character-cid.html">Cid：技术服务</a></li><li><a href="character-nova.html">Nova：另一位医疗联系人</a></li></ul></section>
